  {
    "id": "tongjian-jishi-benmo:vol01:p2",
    "workId": "tongjian-jishi-benmo",
    "volumeId": "vol01",
    "order": 2,
    "text": "臣光曰：臣聞天子之職莫大於禮，禮莫大於分，分莫大於名。何謂禮？紀綱是也。何謂分？君、臣是也。何謂名？公、侯、卿、大夫是也。",
    "sourcePage": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%80%9A%E9%91%91%E7%B4%80%E4%BA%8B%E6%9C%AC%E6%9C%AB/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%8D%B7",
